text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'All Sliver creatures get +1/+1.', 'All Sliver creatures have "{2}: This creature gets +0/+1 until end of turn."', 'All Sliver creatures have "{2}: This creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn."', 'All Sliver creatures have first strike.', 'All Sliver creatures have flying.', 'All Sliver creatures have haste.', 'All Sliver creatures have trample.', 'All Slivers have "{2}, Sacrifice this permanent: Draw a card."', 'All Slivers have "{2}, Sacrifice this permanent: Target player discards a card at random. Activate only as a sorcery."', 'All Slivers have "{2}: Regenerate this permanent."', "All artifacts have shroud. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities.)", 'All creatures lose all abilities and have base power and toughness 1/1.', 'All lands are 2/2 creatures that are still lands.', 'Any player may cast creature spells with mana value 3 or less without paying their mana costs and as though they had flash.', 'Artifacts and lands enter the battlefield tapped.', 'As Booby Trap enters the battlefield, choose an opponent and a card name other than a basic land card name.\nThe chosen player reveals each card they draw.\nWhen the chosen player draws a card with the chosen name, sacrifice Booby Trap. If you do, Booby Trap deals 10 damage to that player.', "As Pallimud enters the battlefield, choose an opponent.\nPallimud's power is equal to the number of tapped lands the chosen player controls.", "As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard X cards.\nLook at target opponent's hand and choose X cards from it. That player discards those cards.", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard X land cards.\nDestroy X target lands.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nSpontaneous Combustion deals 3 damage to each creature.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a land.\nSearch your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "As long as Static Orb is untapped, players can't untap more than two permanents during their untap steps.", 'As long as an opponent controls a creature with flying not named Escaped Shapeshifter, Escaped Shapeshifter has flying. The same is true for first strike, trample, and protection from any color.', "At the beginning of each player's precombat main phase, that player adds {G}{G}.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, Ancient Runes deals damage to that player equal to the number of artifacts they control.", 'At the beginning of each upkeep, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, Jinxed Idol deals 2 damage to you.\nSacrifice a creature: Target opponent gains control of Jinxed Idol.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if there are no Reflection tokens on the battlefield, create a 2/2 white Reflection creature token.\n{0}: Destroy target Reflection.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have five or more cards in hand, Thumbscrews deals 1 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have three or fewer cards in hand, Scalding Tongs deals 1 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, put a pain counter on Torture Chamber.\nAt the beginning of your end step, Torture Chamber deals damage to you equal to the number of pain counters on it.\n{1}, {T}, Remove all pain counters from Torture Chamber: It deals damage to target creature equal to the number of pain counters removed this way.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may look at the top card of target opponent's library. If you do, you may put that card on the bottom of that player's library.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may look at the top three cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a treasure counter on Legacy's Allure.\nSacrifice Legacy's Allure: Gain control of target creature with power less than or equal to the number of treasure counters on Legacy's Allure. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)", "Black creatures can't attack or block.", 'Black spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'Blue spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', "Buyback {2} (You may pay an additional {2} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nAs an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\nYou gain life equal to the sacrificed creature's toughness.", 'Buyback {2} (You may pay an additional {2} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nChange the text of target permanent by replacing all instances of one color word with another or one basic land type with another until end of turn. (For example, you may change "nonred creature" to "nongreen creature" or "plainswalk" to "swampwalk.")', 'Buyback {2} (You may pay an additional {2} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nReturn the top creature card of your graveyard to the battlefield. That creature gains haste until end of turn. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.', "Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nEvincar's Justice deals 2 damage to each creature and each player.", 'Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nPrevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn.', 'Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nReturn target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nReturn target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nTarget creature attacks this turn if able.', 'Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nThe next time a source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', 'Buyback {4} (You may pay an additional {4} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nSearing Touch deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Buyback {4} (You may pay an additional {4} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nTarget creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Buyback {5} (You may pay an additional {5} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\nDraw a card.', 'Caldera Lake enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}. Caldera Lake deals 1 damage to you.', 'Cast this spell only before the combat damage step.\nTarget attacking or blocking creature gets +4/+0 until end of turn. Destroy that creature at the beginning of the next end step.', "Cast this spell only if you've cast another spell this turn.\nFlying", 'Chaotic Goo enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may flip a coin. If you win the flip, put a +1/+1 counter on Chaotic Goo. If you lose the flip, remove a +1/+1 counter from Chaotic Goo.', "Charging Rhino can't be blocked by more than one creature.", "Counter target activated ability from an artifact, creature, enchantment, or land. That permanent's activated abilities can't be activated this turn. (Mana abilities can't be targeted.)\nDraw a card.", "Counter target spell unless its controller pays {X}. If that player doesn't, they tap all lands with mana abilities they control and lose all unspent mana.", "Counter target spell with mana value X. (For example, if that spell's mana cost is {3}{U}{U}, X is 5.)", 'Counter target spell.', 'Counter target spell.\nDraw a card.', "Creatures can't attack you unless their controller pays {2} for each creature they control that's attacking you.", "Creatures with power 3 or greater don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", 'Creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nWall of Diffusion can block creatures with shadow as though Wall of Diffusion had shadow.", 'Destroy X target nonblack creatures. Draw X cards.', 'Destroy all Islands.', 'Destroy all creatures of the creature type of your choice.', "Destroy all creatures that aren't enchanted. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy all enchantments.', "Destroy all green creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact, creature, or land. Aftershock deals 3 damage to you.', 'Destroy target artifact.', 'Destroy target enchantment. You gain life equal to its mana value.', 'Destroy target land.', "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy two target nonblack creatures. You lose 5 life.', 'Discard a card: Regenerate Patchwork Gnomes. (The next time this creature would be destroyed, instead tap it, remove it from combat, and heal all damage on it.)', 'Draw four cards. You skip your next turn.', 'Draw three cards, then put two cards from your hand both on top of your library or both on the bottom of your library.', "During combat, players can't cast instant spells or activate abilities that aren't mana abilities.", 'Each player exiles all creature cards from their graveyard, then sacrifices all creatures they control, then puts all cards they exiled this way onto the battlefield.', "Enchant creature\nAs Flickering Ward enters the battlefield, choose a color.\nEnchanted creature has protection from the chosen color. This effect doesn't remove Flickering Ward.\n{W}: Return Flickering Ward to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated. That creature's controller may sacrifice a permanent for that player to ignore this effect until end of turn.\n{1}{U}: Return Volrath's Curse to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+5.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+0 as long as it's attacking. Otherwise, it gets -2/-1.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.\nWhen enchanted creature becomes the target of a spell or ability, destroy that creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Enchant creature\nEndless Scream enters the battlefield with X scream counters on it.\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+0 for each scream counter on Endless Scream.', 'Enchant creature\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\nWhen Frog Tongue enters the battlefield, draw a card.\nEnchanted creature has reach. (It can block creatures with flying.)', 'Enchant creature\nWhenever a creature dies, put a +1/+1 counter on enchanted creature.', "Enchant creature\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\n{R}: Return Crown of Flames to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature gets -2/-2.', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature has flying. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\n{U}: Return Shimmering Wings to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant enchantment\nYou control enchanted enchantment.', 'Exchange control of target artifact or creature and another target permanent that shares one of those types with it. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)', 'Exile all permanents. You discard your hand.', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\nWhen Commander Greven il-Vec enters the battlefield, sacrifice a creature.", 'First strike', 'First strike\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if your opponents control no creatures, Kezzerdrix deals 4 damage to you.', 'First strike\nWhenever Renegade Warlord attacks, each other attacking creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'First strike\n{G}: Regenerate Ranger en-Vec.', 'First strike\n{W}: Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.', 'First strike\n{W}{W}: Knight of Dawn gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\n{R}: Sandstone Warrior gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying', "Flying\nAs Dracoplasm enters the battlefield, sacrifice any number of creatures. Dracoplasm's power becomes the total power of those creatures and its toughness becomes their total toughness.\n{R}: Dracoplasm gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", 'Flying\nDiscard a creature card: Skyshroud Vampire gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', "Flying\nFylamarid can't be blocked by blue creatures.\n{U}: Target creature becomes blue until end of turn.", "Flying\nPay 2 life: Return Selenia, Dark Angel to its owner's hand.", "Flying\nWhen Avenging Angel dies, you may put it on top of its owner's library.", 'Flying\nWhen Cloudchaser Eagle enters the battlefield, destroy target enchantment.', 'Flying\nWhenever Angelic Protector becomes the target of a spell or ability, Angelic Protector gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', "Flying\nWhenever Bellowing Fiend deals damage to a creature, Bellowing Fiend deals 3 damage to that creature's controller and 3 damage to you.", 'Flying\nWhenever Flailing Drake blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{1}, Discard a card at random: Canyon Drake gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{1}{B}: Regenerate Screeching Harpy.', 'Flying\n{B}: Pit Imp gets +1/+0 until end of turn. Activate no more than twice each turn.', 'Flying\n{R}: Firefly gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{R}: Flowstone Wyvern gets +2/-2 until end of turn.', "Flying\n{T}, Tap two untapped creatures you control: Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\n{T}: Mawcor deals 1 damage to any target.', "Flying\n{T}: Non-Wall creatures the active player controls attack this turn if able. At the beginning of the next end step, destroy each of those creatures that didn't attack this turn. Activate only during an opponent's turn and only before combat.", 'Flying\n{T}: Target creature gains flying until end of turn.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhen Rathi Dragon enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you sacrifice two Mountains.", 'Flying, first strike', "Flying; swampwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", "Forestwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", 'Green spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', 'Heartwood Dryad can block creatures with shadow as though Heartwood Dryad had shadow.', 'If a creature with a magnet counter on it attacks, all creatures with magnet counters on them attack if able.\nWhenever a creature with a magnet counter on it attacks, all creatures with magnet counters on them block that creature this turn if able.\n{1}, {T}: Put a magnet counter on target creature.', 'If a source would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals double that damage to that permanent or player instead.', "Islands don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)", 'Kindle deals X damage to any target, where X is 2 plus the number of cards named Kindle in all graveyards.', 'Krakilin enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\n{1}{G}: Regenerate Krakilin.', 'Lightning Blast deals 4 damage to any target.', "Magmasaur enters the battlefield with five +1/+1 counters on it.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may remove a +1/+1 counter from Magmasaur. If you don't, sacrifice Magmasaur and it deals damage equal to the number of +1/+1 counters on it to each creature without flying and each player.", "Mogg Conscripts can't attack unless you've cast a creature spell this turn.", 'Mogg Squad gets -1/-1 for each other creature on the battlefield.', "Mountainwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", 'Needle Storm deals 4 damage to each creature with flying.', "Other Elf creatures have forestwalk. (They can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)\nOther Elves have shroud. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities.)", 'Pay 3 life: Put a +1/+1 counter on Souldrinker.', 'Pine Barrens enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}. Pine Barrens deals 1 damage to you.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn. You gain 1 life for each attacking creature.', 'Protection from black\nShadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)', 'Protection from red\nShadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)', 'Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. You lose life equal to its mana value.', "Put target creature on top of its owner's library.", 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\n{W}: Mounted Archers can block an additional creature this turn.', 'Red spells cost {2} more to cast.', 'Red spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', "Return Broken Fall to its owner's hand: Regenerate target creature.", 'Return up to X target cards from your graveyard to your hand, where X is the number of black permanents target opponent controls as you cast this spell.', 'Rolling Thunder deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of targets.', 'Sacrifice Blood Pet: Add {B}.', 'Sacrifice Bottle Gnomes: You gain 3 life.', 'Sacrifice Mogg Fanatic: It deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Sacrifice a Goblin: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Sacrifice a Swamp: Marsh Lurker gains fear until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'Sacrifice a creature: Goblin Bombardment deals 1 damage to any target.', "Sacrifice a creature: Target player mills cards equal to the sacrificed creature's power.", 'Sacrifice an enchantment: Auratog gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Sacrifice two creatures: Create a 3/1 red Beast creature token named Carnivore.', 'Salt Flats enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}. Salt Flats deals 1 damage to you.', 'Scabland enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}. Scabland deals 1 damage to you.', "Sea Monster can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.", 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for any number of land cards, exile them, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for three cards and reveal them. Target opponent chooses one. Put that card into your hand and the rest into your graveyard. Then shuffle.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)', "Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nDauthi Horror can't be blocked by white creatures.", 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nDauthi Slayer attacks each combat if able.', "Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nSoltari Lancer has first strike as long as it's attacking.", 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nWhen Thalakos Seer leaves the battlefield, draw a card.', "Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nWhenever Dauthi Mindripper attacks and isn't blocked, you may sacrifice it. If you do, defending player discards three cards.", 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nWhenever Soltari Trooper attacks, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nWhenever a creature with shadow dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Dauthi Ghoul.', "Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nYou may choose not to untap Thalakos Dreamsower during your untap step.\nWhenever Thalakos Dreamsower deals damage to an opponent, tap target creature. That creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step for as long as Thalakos Dreamsower remains tapped.", 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\n{0}: The next time Soltari Guerrillas would deal combat damage to an opponent this turn, it deals that damage to target creature instead.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\n{1}{B}: Dauthi Mercenary gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\n{1}{W}: Soltari Crusader gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\n{U}: Put Thalakos Mistfolk on top of its owner's library.", 'Shadowstorm deals 2 damage to each creature with shadow.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Skip your draw step.\nWhenever you play a card, draw a card.\nYour maximum hand size is two.', 'Skyshroud Forest enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}. Skyshroud Forest deals 1 damage to you.', 'Spike Drone enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Drone: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "Sudden Impact deals damage to target player equal to the number of cards in that player's hand.", 'Tap an untapped creature you control: Telethopter gains flying until end of turn.', 'Tap an untapped creature you control: Untap target basic land.', 'Tap target creature. It deals damage equal to its power to another target creature.', 'Target blocking creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.\nDraw a card.', "Target creature can't block this turn.\nDraw a card.", 'Target creature deals damage to itself equal to its power.', 'Target creature gains shadow until end of turn. (It can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature loses shadow until end of turn.\nDraw a card.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player gains 8 life.', "Target player reveals their hand, then you choose a card other than a basic land card from it. Search that player's graveyard, hand, and library for all cards with the same name as the chosen card and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", 'Target player sacrifices a creature.', 'Target player takes an extra turn after this one.', "This spell can't be countered.\nProtection from blue", "Trample\nAs Minion of the Wastes enters the battlefield, pay any amount of life.\nMinion of the Wastes's power and toughness are each equal to the life paid as it entered the battlefield.", "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", 'Watchdog blocks each combat if able.\nAs long as Watchdog is untapped, all creatures attacking you get -1/-0.', "When Duplicity enters the battlefield, exile the top five cards of your library face down.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may exile all cards from your hand face down. If you do, put all other cards you own exiled with Duplicity into your hand.\nAt the beginning of your end step, discard a card.\nWhen you lose control of Duplicity, put all cards exiled with Duplicity into their owner's graveyard.", 'When Gravedigger enters the battlefield, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Mongrel Pack dies during combat, create four 1/1 green Dog creature tokens.', 'When Sarcomancy enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if there are no Zombies on the battlefield, Sarcomancy deals 1 damage to you.', 'When Servant of Volrath leaves the battlefield, sacrifice a creature.', 'When Staunch Defenders enters the battlefield, you gain 4 life.', "When Wild Wurm enters the battlefield, flip a coin. If you lose the flip, return Wild Wurm to its owner's hand.", "Whenever Apes of Rath attacks, it doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", 'Whenever Elite Javelineer blocks, it deals 1 damage to target attacking creature.', "Whenever Elven Warhounds becomes blocked by a creature, put that creature on top of its owner's library.", 'Whenever Fugitive Druid becomes the target of an Aura spell, you draw a card.', 'Whenever Jackal Pup is dealt damage, it deals that much damage to you.', 'Whenever Segmented Wurm becomes the target of a spell or ability, put a -1/-1 counter on it.', 'Whenever Shocker deals damage to a player, that player discards all the cards in their hand, then draws that many cards.', 'Whenever a creature becomes blocked by a creature with lesser power, destroy the blocking creature.\nWhenever a creature blocks a creature with lesser power, destroy the attacking creature.', "Whenever a creature is dealt damage, destroy it. It can't be regenerated.", 'Whenever a nontoken creature is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a green spell, you draw a card.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a red spell, you gain 2 life.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a white spell, they lose 2 life.', 'Whenever an opponent plays a land, put a +1/+1 counter on Dirtcowl Wurm.', 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, Unstable Shapeshifter becomes a copy of that creature, except it has this ability.', 'Whenever one or more creatures attack you, you gain 1 life for each attacking creature.', 'White creatures get -1/-1.', 'White spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', "X can't be 0.\nTarget spell's controller exiles it with X delay counters on it.\nAt the beginning of each of that player's upkeeps, if that card is exiled, remove a delay counter from it. If the card has no delay counters on it, the player puts it onto the stack as a copy of the original spell.", 'You may cast Aura spells with enchant creature as though they had flash.', 'You may choose not to untap Coffin Queen during your untap step.\n{2}{B}, {T}: Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. When Coffin Queen becomes untapped or you lose control of Coffin Queen, exile that creature.', 'You may choose not to untap Helm of Possession during your untap step.\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Gain control of target creature for as long as you control Helm of Possession and Helm of Possession remains tapped.', 'You may tap or untap target artifact, creature, or land.\nDraw a card.', '{1}, {T}: Exile any number of cards from your hand face down. Put that many cards from the top of your library into your hand. Then look at the exiled cards and put them on top of your library in any order.', '{1}: The next time a black source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}: The next time a blue source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}: The next time a creature of your choice with shadow would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}: The next time a green source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}: The next time a red source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}: The next time a white source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}{G}: Regenerate Skyshroud Troll.', '{1}{G}: Rootwalla gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', '{1}{G}: Target creature blocks Trumpeting Armodon this turn if able.', "{1}{U}, {T}: Stinging Licid loses this ability and becomes an Aura enchantment with enchant creature. Attach it to target creature. You may pay {U} to end this effect.\nWhenever enchanted creature becomes tapped, Stinging Licid deals 2 damage to that creature's controller.", '{1}{W}, Sacrifice Sacred Guide: Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a white card. Put that card into your hand and exile all other cards revealed this way.', '{1}{W}, {T}: Quickening Licid loses this ability and becomes an Aura enchantment with enchant creature. Attach it to target creature. You may pay {W} to end this effect.\nEnchanted creature has first strike.', '{2}, Discard a card: Create a 1/1 white Pegasus creature token with flying.', '{2}, Discard a card: Put a +1/+1 counter on Flowstone Sculpture or Flowstone Sculpture gains flying, first strike, or trample. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)', '{2}, {T}, Choose flying, first strike, trample, or shadow: Until end of turn, target creature with the chosen ability loses it and another target creature gains it.', '{2}, {T}: Draw a card. Activate only if you have no cards in hand.', '{2}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Energizer.', '{2}, {T}: You may tap or untap target creature.', "{2}{B}{B}: Exile Carrionette and target creature unless that creature's controller pays {2}. Activate only if Carrionette is in your graveyard.", '{2}{B}{B}: Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature.', '{2}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{2}{W}: Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt by target creature this turn.', '{3}, {T}: Choose a card name, then reveal a card at random from your hand. If that card has the chosen name, Cursed Scroll deals 2 damage to any target.', '{3}, {T}: Put an elixir counter on Essence Bottle.\n{T}, Remove all elixir counters from Essence Bottle: You gain 2 life for each elixir counter removed this way.', '{3}, {T}: Target player mills two cards. If two cards that share a color were milled this way, repeat this process.', '{3}: Exile target creature you control.\nSacrifice Cold Storage: Return each creature card exiled with Cold Storage to the battlefield under your control.', "{4}, {T}: An opponent chooses target creature they control. Create a token that's a copy of that creature. That token gains haste until end of turn. Exile the token at the beginning of the next end step. Activate only as a sorcery.", '{4}, {T}: Target opponent chooses one of the top two cards of your graveyard. Exile that card and put the other one into your hand.', '{5}, {T}: Draw two cards, then discard a card.', "{B}, {T}: Leeching Licid loses this ability and becomes an Aura enchantment with enchant creature. Attach it to target creature. You may pay {B} to end this effect.\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, Leeching Licid deals 1 damage to that player.", '{B}: Destroy target artifact, creature, or land you control.', '{B}: Regenerate Darkling Stalker.\n{B}: Darkling Stalker gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{B}{B}: Destroy target creature blocking Knight of Dusk.', '{B}{B}: Target creature gains shadow until end of turn. (It can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)', '{G}, {T}: Nurturing Licid loses this ability and becomes an Aura enchantment with enchant creature. Attach it to target creature. You may pay {G} to end this effect.\n{G}: Regenerate enchanted creature.', '{G}: Crazed Armodon gets +3/+0 and gains trample until end of turn. Destroy Crazed Armodon at the beginning of the next end step. Activate only once each turn.', '{G}{G}: Tap target creature with flying.', '{R}, {T}: Enraging Licid loses this ability and becomes an Aura enchantment with enchant creature. Attach it to target creature. You may pay {R} to end this effect.\nEnchanted creature has haste.', '{R}: Flowstone Giant gets +2/-2 until end of turn.', '{R}: Flowstone Salamander deals 1 damage to target creature blocking it.', '{T}, Sacrifice Lotus Petal: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}, Sacrifice Rootwater Diver: Return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{T}, Sacrifice a Forest: Heartwood Giant deals 2 damage to target player or planeswalker.', "{T}, Sacrifice a basic land: Target creature gains landwalk of each of the land types of the sacrificed land until end of turn. (It can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a land of any of those types.)", '{T}: Add one mana of any type that a land you control could produce.', '{T}: Add {C}.', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{0}: Return Ghost Town to its owner's hand. Activate only if it's not your turn.", "{T}: Add {C}.\n{6}: Stalking Stones becomes a 3/3 Elemental artifact creature that's still a land. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}, Sacrifice Wasteland: Destroy target nonbasic land.', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}. Cinder Marsh doesn't untap during your next untap step.", "{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}. Vec Townships doesn't untap during your next untap step.", "{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}. Mogg Hollows doesn't untap during your next untap step.", "{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}. Rootwater Depths doesn't untap during your next untap step.", "{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}. Thalakos Lowlands doesn't untap during your next untap step.", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Untap target attacking creature with shadow. Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by that creature this turn.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Ancient Tomb deals 2 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {G}.\n{1}: Add {R} or {W}.', '{T}: Choose a creature card name. Reveal the top four cards of your library and put all of them with that name into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard.', "{T}: Destroy target artifact or creature. That permanent's controller gains control of Starke of Rath. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)", '{T}: Fireslinger deals 1 damage to any target and 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Gain control of target creature for as long as that creature is enchanted.', '{T}: Opportunist deals 1 damage to target creature that was dealt damage this turn.', '{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', '{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn.', '{T}: Prevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', '{T}: Put a bounty counter on target nonblack creature.\n{T}: Destroy target creature with a bounty counter on it.', '{T}: Rootwater Hunter deals 1 damage to any target.', '{T}: Target creature you control gets +1/+0 and gains flying until end of turn. Destroy that creature at the beginning of the next end step.', "{T}: Target opponent chooses any number of creatures they control. During that player's next turn, the chosen creatures attack if able, and other creatures can't attack. At the beginning of that turn's end step, destroy each of the chosen creatures that didn't attack this turn. Activate only during your turn.", '{T}: Untap target creature.', '{T}: Until end of turn, target creature has base power 1 or base toughness 1.', '{T}: You may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield. Activate only as a sorcery.', "{U}: Giant Crab gains shroud until end of turn. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", '{U}: Manta Riders gains flying until end of turn.', '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{W}: Soltari Emissary gains shadow until end of turn. (It can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)']
